  "notes": [
    "Irregular -ER verb: o→hue stem change in stressed syllables (unique: adds h before ue)",
    "Stem changes in: Presente (yo/tú/él/ellos) and Subjuntivo Presente (yo/tú/él/ellos); nosotros/nosotras keeps base stem *ol-*",
    "Past participle: olido (regular)",
    "*Oler a* = to smell of/like: *Huele a pan recién hecho* = It smells of freshly baked bread",
    "*Oler bien/mal* = to smell good/bad",
    "*Me huele que...* = I have a feeling that... (figurative)",
    "Related: el olor (smell), oloroso (fragrant), el olfato (sense of smell)"
